Authentication:
  - User can sign up with email/password
  - User can sign in with correct credentials
  - User cannot sign in with wrong password
  - JWT token expires after 15 minutes
  - Refresh token generates new access token
  - Rate limiter blocks after 5 failed attempts
  - Google OAuth returns valid user

AI Gateway:
  - Chat completion returns response from OpenAI
  - Chat completion returns response from Anthropic
  - Streaming returns SSE events
  - Provider failover works when primary fails
  - Cost estimation is within 10% of actual
  - Rate limit enforced per plan

Billing:
  - Checkout creates Stripe session
  - Webhook activates subscription
  - Subscription cancellation works
  - Invoice generated after payment
  - Usage limits enforced per plan

Trust & Safety:
  - Evidence engine detects sources
  - Hallucination detector flags unsupported claims
  - AI Judge scores response quality
  - Safety engine blocks dangerous actions
